# WIP 1 — Windigitaly AI Lead Conversion Copilot

## 1. Project Overview

WIP 1 focuses on developing the initial prototype of the Windigitaly AI Lead Conversion Copilot using Lovable.

The objective is to create a system that helps manage business enquiries, organize leads, monitor the sales pipeline, and identify follow-up opportunities.

The prototype establishes the initial interface and structure for improving the agency's lead management process.

## 2. Development Platform

- **Platform:** Lovable
- **Project Name:** Windigitaly AI — Lead Conversion Copilot
- **Version:** 1.0 Prototype
- **Application Type:** Web-based prototype

## 3. Prototype Links

- **Live Website:** [Open Windigitaly AI Lead Conversion Copilot](https://windigitaly-lead-conversion-copilot.lovable.app/)
