## 4. Main Features Developed

### A. Overview Dashboard

The dashboard provides a summary of the leads saved in the browser.

It displays:
- Total leads
- Leads requiring follow-up
- Qualified leads
- Won leads
- Recent lead records
- Lead status distribution
- Recommended next actions

### B. Lead Management

The prototype displays lead information, including:
- Business or prospect name
- Required marketing service
- Enquiry source
- Lead priority
- Current lead status

The sample records use fictional business names.

### C. AI Assistant

An AI Assistant section is included in the application's navigation for enquiry analysis and lead assistance.

### D. Message Studio

A dedicated Message Studio section is included for managing lead communication.

### E. Insights

An Insights section is included to support the review of lead pipeline performance.

### F. Settings & Guide

A separate section provides application settings and usage guidance.

