## 6. Technology and Current Limitations

The displayed Version 1 prototype uses local rules and templates.

According to the application interface:
- No external AI integration is active in this version.
- Data stays in the browser.
- Lead information is demonstrated through browser-saved sample records.

Therefore, this stage represents the initial prototype and lead-management interface, not a fully integrated AI-powered automation system.

## 7. Expected Development Direction

The prototype provides a foundation for further development, including:

- More structured enquiry analysis
- Improved lead qualification
- Follow-up recommendations
- Lead conversion insights
- Integration with external services and databases
- More automated lead management

These are future development areas, not features claimed as completed in Version 1.

## 8. Outcome of WIP 1

WIP 1 established the initial interface and functional concept of the Windigitaly AI Lead Conversion Copilot.

It introduced the dashboard, lead management structure, priority and status tracking, and supporting application sections.

This prototype provided the foundation for subsequent operational analysis and development work.
